{"c":[{"name":"20260919T183142Z-62bc24835e4cc470","text":"Caret.app always starts its own screenpipe@0.4.50 on :3031 and does not attach to a manual or launchd instance; a second recorder can stop the first.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T183914Z-5f4c9ce43ef55285","text":"INFOPLIST_KEY_CaretProjectRoot does not land in GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE output, so shipped Caret.app has no project root and ScreenpipeSupervisor.start is a no-op until that key is actually in Info.plist.","type":"note"}]}
